From cba54e6a2e4ab05a16b5a23f336ee0d4f59172d8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Owen <3221756+christopherowen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 22:54:08 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] TileLang Engram hash kernel

One launch hashes each token for every Engram layer and head with B12X's
arithmetic (DeepSeek's n-gram XOR of odd multipliers modulo per-head primes)
and publishes the request and live token counts. The Engram layout keeps its
tokenizer map for it. No caller yet.
